        "id": 5642
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-24T20:53:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This excludes animated image support, which is probably ok for now - but it would make for some cool demos :)\n\nWe could support that if we keep the image asset around and resolve to a shader in `onSync`, for every frame (there is also a way to tell whether an image asset is animating, so we only have to rebuild those shaders).\n\nMaybe add a comment/todo.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 59
      },
